{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids","id":266635,"title":"Faerie Hybrids?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-26T21:50:31-07:00","id":266635,"title":"Faerie Hybrids?","content":"Has anyone considered playing a Fae who was descended from two different Kiths mingling bloodlines? How did it work out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T21:43:21-07:00","id":267190,"title":"","content":"Well CtD birthing and such does not actually work like that. That is to say a child of two Changelings is a Kinain, which naturally makes it more likely to get a Fae soul when born if one is available and it is in such cases usually a soul that goes along with one the parent Kiths. Changelings do not normally have new Fae children born to them, unless were talking about Adhene, and the souls tend to not mix. In the case of Adhene they do generally mate amongst their own kind having new Fae souls born as their children, but then again unlike actual Kiths these Adhene souls are mortal they do age even in the Dreaming, and even then I would rule it in one or the other parents favor or even say that the two races are incompatible and can have no children together.<br /> <br /> I think the best place to look for information about Kithain reproduction is Enchanted but I'm not sure how much it goes into it. Generally though the Kithain themselves believe, and the books do not generally contradict it, is that their Fae souls are immortal and no new Fae souls are currently born just the old ones get reincarnated. This of course does not include the Sidhe whose Souls just seem to escape into the Dreaming or disappear altogether their fates a mystery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T23:34:36-07:00","id":267230,"title":"","content":"that makes me wonder...what happends when a changeling mates with any other supernatural?.. i got a mage player who has a crush on a fae so im wondering","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T04:38:28-07:00","id":267310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids?p=267230#post267230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">that makes me wonder...what happends when a changeling mates with any other supernatural?.. i got a mage player who has a crush on a fae so im wondering</div> </div> </div> </div>A Kinain if it's a mortal (mage, sorcerer, etc.)<br /> A Kinain and Kinfolk if it's a shapeshifter (those propagating per bloodline)<br /> A couple problems if it's a vampire (unless it's a thin blood, in which case it COULD be a KINAIN AND DAMPHIR \u00b0__\u00b0 )<br /> Nothing if it's a mummy (infertile) or wraith (incorporeal)<br /> <br /> DON'T EVER THINK TO FOMORI","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T09:58:35-07:00","id":267461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryoga84</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids?p=267310#post267310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A Kinain if it's a mortal (mage, sorcerer, etc.)<br /> A Kinain and Kinfolk if it's a shapeshifter (those propagating per bloodline)<br /> A couple problems if it's a vampire (unless it's a thin blood, in which case it COULD be a KINAIN AND DAMPHIR \u00b0__\u00b0 )<br /> Nothing if it's a mummy (infertile) or wraith (incorporeal)<br /> <br /> DON'T EVER THINK TO FOMORI</div> </div> </div> </div>Or Yang aspected KJ for Dhampir<br /> I'm more curious though how Revenant stuff stacks.. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+x