mber","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T10:32:04-07:00","id":270904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids?p=267230#post267230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">that makes me wonder...what happends when a changeling mates with any other supernatural?.. i got a mage player who has a crush on a fae so im wondering</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on the kith...they probably have a good time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2214-traveller","name":"Traveller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2214_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T12:06:34-07:00","id":271019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids?p=270879#post270879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Vampire - Kyasid<br /> Werewolf - Fianna (distant cousins)<br /> Mage - Cult of Ecstasy or Verbena (ish, not real sure what Tradition deals with the Fae the most)<br /> Wraith - None<br /> Hunters - Depends on the Hunter<br /> Mummy - None<br /> Demon - Ah HHHEEELLLL............. No!<br /> Kuie Jin - No idea</div> </div> </div> </div>There are some serious errors here, notably given that Kiasyd aren't the result of sex, Fianna aren't the only tribe to have fae ties and aren't really raring to adopt a cub just because said cub is part-fae, and Traditions in Mage are generally not about how fae-friendly they are even if you are part fae.<br /> <br /> Further clarifications: KotE would go with Wraith here, and Imbued are specifically unable to have children with monsters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T20:48:53-07:00","id":271360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids?p=271019#post271019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are some serious errors here, notably given that Kiasyd aren't the result of sex, Fianna aren't the only tribe to have fae ties and aren't really raring to adopt a cub just because said cub is part-fae, and Traditions in Mage are generally not about how fae-friendly they are even if you are part fae.<br /> <br /> Further clarifications: KotE would go with Wraith here, and Imbued are specifically unable to have children with monsters.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> KoTE can have kids. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T23:20:26-07:00","id":271432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids?p=271360#post271360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> KoTE can have kids.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only if Yang-imbalanced, and the result is always a dhampyr, if the coupling can produce a child at all. This doesn't happen with shapeshifters, so it's not likely for them to be compatible with changelings, either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T23:58:57-07:00","id":271438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/266635-faerie-hybrids?p=271432#post271432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Only if Yang-imbalanced, and the result is always a dhampyr, if the coupling can produce a child at all. This doesn't happen with shapeshifters, so it's not likely for them to be compatible with changelings, either.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Changelings are more spiritually fragile I'd say a KJ and a changelinge would make a Dhampir unlike other stuff which tends to fuzz out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T11:05:10-07:00","id":279903,"title":"","content":"Ok, the canon splats have been covered here. I would like to add that my own game took a flaw from &quot;Kithbook: Sluagh&quot; (&quot;Knows Too Much&quot;) and expounded thusly (so, make of it what you will): <br /> <br /> &quot;...Another factor in Changeling breeding is that there are no &quot;half-breed&quot; Changelings. If a Troll and a Satyr mate, the child will be either a Troll or a Satyr (or Kinain). The other Fae blood can linger, though, and later generations can express that latent blood of other kiths. If a Troll and a Satyr breed, producing a Satyr, then the child (or grand- child) of that Satyr could well be a Troll. Likewise the original Satyr child could die, and reincarnate as a Troll, with perhaps memories of their Satyr past. For the most part, kith stick to their own when breeding.<br /> <br /> Sidhe are an exception to much of the above. In 1969, the Sidhe just &quot;appeared&quot; in mortal bodies. Some of them took over already existing mortals, while some just appeared with bodies from who-knows-where. Since that time, they have had breeding patterns similar to other Changelings, but they do not have the mingled blood and lost lines of descent that other Changelings do, at least not yet.<br /> <br /> There has been only one or two generations of Sidhe children since the resurgence, but in every way they match the patterns of other Changeling breeding...&quot; taken from:<a href=\"http://w11.zetaboards.com/LivingWoD/topic/10260534/1/#new\" target=\"_blank\">http://w11.zetaboards.com/LivingWoD/...0260534/1/#new</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T01:55:46-08:00","id":362233,"title":"","content":"Thank you for this Sara RPs!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}